# Force LF for files that break under CRLF:
#  - Cargo manifests/locks: Cargo rejects CR inside TOML basic strings,
#    and Docker builds copy the working tree directly into Linux images.
#  - Shell scripts: a CR in a shebang breaks execution on Linux/CI.
# core.autocrlf=true on Windows would otherwise rewrite these as CRLF
# on every checkout.
*.toml    text eol=lf
Cargo.lock text eol=lf
*.sh      text eol=lf
